# Cloudflare Pages response headers. Hashed build files never change under the same name; the big static assets rarely do.
# Security headers for every response. The CSP lists exactly the hosts the game fetches (imagery, DEM, buildings, trees, weather, Leaflet map tiles); blob: workers and wasm are for Draco.
# Cloudflare Web Analytics (enabled on the Pages project): its beacon script and its reporting endpoint.
# Enforced: checked with the production build in Chrome (boot, flight, map, Germany and Japan teleports, all worker fetches): no violations (sr71-tools/verify/csp-check.mjs).
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), display-capture=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=(), fullscreen=(self), gamepad=(self)
